\pard\b\fs20 Year 899: Aiming High in Sybiria\b0\par
\fs16\par
At last! With rocket technology we have now solved the last problem of our mission. We now know how we can and will leave this planet! All that remains is to test this knowledge on a prototype, and to produce the engines in sufficient numbers. Since we know that this takes a great deal of resources, the task will be carried out in resource-rich Sybiria.\par
\par
\b Goal:\b0\par
Produce 5 engines and 20 canisters of fuel.\par
